{title: 483 - I Need Thee Every Hour}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #483 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Ab}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 483}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Ab]I need Thee [Eb]every [Ab]hour,
[Ab7]Most [Db]gracious [Ab]Lord;
No [Eb]tender voice like [Ab]Thine
Can [Eb]peace [Bb7]af[Eb]ford.
[Ab]I need Thee, [Db]O I [Ab]need [Eb]Thee;
[Eb7]Every hour I need [Ab]Thee;
[Ab7]O[Db]bless me now, my [Ab]Savior—
[Db]I[Ab]come [Eb7]to[Ab]Thee.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Ab]I need [Eb]thee, O [Ab]I need thee;
[Ab7]every [Db]hour I [Ab]need thee;
[Eb]O bless me now, my [Ab]Savior, I come to thee.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Ab]I need [Eb]thee every hour; [Ab]stay thou nearby;
[Ab7]temptations lose [Db]their power when [Ab]thou art nigh.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Ab]I need thee [Eb]every hour, in [Ab]joy or pain;
[Ab7]come quickly [Db]and abide, or [Ab]life is vain.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Ab]I need thee [Eb]every hour; teach [Ab]me thy will;
[Ab7]and thy [Db]rich promises [Ab]in me fulfill.
{end_of_verse}
